#: library/network/src/yast2-services-translations.rb:112
msgid ""
"Firewall configuration for NFS kernel server. Open ports for NFS to allow "
"other hosts to connect."
msgstr ""
"ການກຳນົດຄ່າໄຟວໍສຳລັບເຊີເວີເຄີເນິລ NFS. ເປີດພອດສຳລັບ NFS ເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ໂຮສອື່ນເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄດ້."

